Package: sciencedb
Title: Search, Inspect, and Download Data from ScienceDB
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jenny", "Xu", , "jennyyzxu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Programmatic interface for ScienceDB (<https://www.scidb.cn/>). Provides functions to search dataset metadata, inspect raw JSON records, and download dataset files directly into local environments.
